% SUSY-2013-12 fig_01d: chargino1 neutralino2 production, decays via W and h to leptons and neutralino1
layout: v2
arrows: none
in: p1 p2
out: l1 nu n1 n2 l2 l3
p1 [p] -- pp [blob]
